{"v":1,"src":"MOV     DX, OFFSET MKM1\nMOV     AH, 09h\nINT     21h\nMOV     AH, 39h          ; DOS: make the directory named at DS:DX\nMOV     DX, OFFSET DIR1\nINT     21h\nCALL    RESULT           ; ok\nMOV     DX, OFFSET AGAINM1\nMOV     AH, 09h\nINT     21h\nMOV     AH, 39h\nMOV     DX, OFFSET DIR1\nINT     21h\nCALL    RESULT           ; error 5: it exists now\nMOV     DX, OFFSET RMM1\nMOV     AH, 09h\nINT     21h\nMOV     AH, 3Ah          ; DOS: remove it again\nMOV     DX, OFFSET DIR1\nINT     21h\nCALL    RESULT\n\nDIR1    DB      \"TESTDIR\", 0\nMKM1    DB      \"mkdir TESTDIR: $\"\nAGAINM1 DB      \"mkdir TESTDIR again: $\"\nRMM1    DB      \"rmdir TESTDIR: $\"\nRESULT  PROC    NEAR     ; print \"ok\", or \"error\" and AX when CF = 1\nPUSHF                    ; keeps AX and CF for the caller\nPUSH    AX\nMOV     DX, OFFSET OKMSG\nJNC     RESULT1\nMOV     DX, OFFSET ERRMSG\nMOV     AH, 09h\nINT     21h\nPOP     AX\nPUSH    AX\nCALL    PDEC             ; the error code\nMOV     DX, OFFSET CRLF\nRESULT1:\nMOV     AH, 09h\nINT     21h\nPOP     AX\nPOPF\nRET\nRESULT  ENDP\nOKMSG   DB      \"ok\", 13, 10, \"$\"\nERRMSG  DB      \"error $\"\nPDEC    PROC    NEAR     ; print AX in decimal (changes AX BX CX DX)\nMOV     BX, 10\nXOR     CX, CX           ; digits on the stack\nPDEC1:\nXOR     DX, DX\nDIV     BX               ; AX = AX / 10, DX = the last digit\nPUSH    DX\nINC     CX\nOR      AX, AX\nJNZ     PDEC1\nPDEC2:\nPOP     DX               ; the digits come back first to last\nADD     DL, \"0\"\nMOV     AH, 02h\nINT     21h\nLOOP    PDEC2\nRET\nPDEC    ENDP\nCRLF    DB      13, 10, \"$\"","seg":2070,"dataAt":312,"vars":[{"name":"DIR1","offset":312,"unit":1,"length":8},{"name":"MKM1","offset":320,"unit":1,"length":16},{"name":"AGAINM1","offset":336,"unit":1,"length":22},{"name":"RMM1","offset":358,"unit":1,"length":45},{"name":"OKMSG","offset":403,"unit":1,"length":5},{"name":"ERRMSG","offset":408,"unit":1,"length":33},{"name":"CRLF","offset":441,"unit":1,"len